WEBVTT

00:00:00.490 --> 00:00:03.770
<i>My name is Hiiragi Seiichi. 
I'm a second-year in high school.</i>

00:00:03.770 --> 00:00:05.980
<i>I ate some Fruit of Evolution 
in another world</i>

00:00:05.980 --> 00:00:07.970
<i>and got an invincible, OP physique!</i>

00:00:08.790 --> 00:00:11.990
<i>I defeated the Black Dragon God, 
and we returned to Telbert.</i>

00:00:11.990 --> 00:00:12.790
<i>Wait, huh?</i>

00:00:12.790 --> 00:00:14.540
<i>Artoria-san's depressed!</i>

00:00:15.310 --> 00:00:17.120
Let's enjoy happiness!

00:00:18.370 --> 00:00:21.330
I'll fully support you!

00:00:24.360 --> 00:00:26.330
I just proposed, didn't I?!

00:00:27.080 --> 00:00:30.090
<i>What's gonna happen to 
my life in another world?!</i>

00:00:30.090 --> 00:00:35.090
<b>Crying Out Love in the Center of Another World</b>

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:44.600
What's the matter, Seiichi?

00:00:44.600 --> 00:00:46.930
You saw what happened earlier, right?

00:00:46.930 --> 00:00:49.360
What I said to Artoria-san...

00:00:52.120 --> 00:00:54.900
Um, g-good morning!

00:00:58.660 --> 00:00:59.910
Artoria-san?

00:01:02.430 --> 00:01:03.930
Artoria-san...

00:01:06.670 --> 00:01:08.830
She's completely avoiding me.

00:01:08.830 --> 00:01:10.400
Don't worry.

00:01:10.400 --> 00:01:13.920
It's not like she hates you.

00:01:14.170 --> 00:01:16.680
How can you be sure about that?!

00:01:16.970 --> 00:01:19.810
Hmm... Natural instinct?

00:01:19.810 --> 00:01:21.520
Because you're a gorilla?!

00:01:21.520 --> 00:01:23.430
Ooh-ooh-ooh!

00:01:23.430 --> 00:01:26.130
Anyway, Saria, what do you want to do today?

00:01:26.130 --> 00:01:26.720
Huh?

00:01:26.720 --> 00:01:30.600
Well, our hunting test got canceled, so...

00:01:30.600 --> 00:01:33.540
Then I think I'll go visit 
the orphanage today.

00:01:33.540 --> 00:01:36.700
Oh, accepting a quest already?

00:01:36.920 --> 00:01:41.090
Yeah. Claire-san did say 
I could come by anytime!

00:01:41.090 --> 00:01:42.190
What about you?

00:01:43.520 --> 00:01:47.560
I think I'm going to gather some 
information instead of doing a quest.

00:01:48.210 --> 00:01:50.530
Then I'll see you later, Seiichi!

00:01:50.530 --> 00:01:51.460
Yeah.

00:01:51.460 --> 00:01:52.750
Okay, then...

00:01:53.270 --> 00:01:56.830
<i>I need to learn more about this new world.</i>

00:02:03.970 --> 00:02:07.220
<b>The Fruit of Evolution:</b>

00:02:03.970 --> 00:02:07.220
<b>\h\hBefore I Knew It,

00:03:29.280 --> 00:03:32.020
The thing is, there's 
some information I want.

00:03:33.020 --> 00:03:37.280
There's my Guscle Style Muscle Camp 
with beginner to advanced courses.

00:03:37.280 --> 00:03:39.030
Which did you want to take?

00:03:39.030 --> 00:03:41.640
No, I don't need any of those.

00:03:41.640 --> 00:03:43.860
This is the problem with muscle-heads.

00:03:44.460 --> 00:03:45.780
Eris-san!

00:03:46.090 --> 00:03:47.950
How do you do, Seiichi-san?

00:03:47.950 --> 00:03:50.540
I have some special information for you.

00:03:50.540 --> 00:03:52.040
Really?!

00:03:52.040 --> 00:03:57.870
Eris-style S&M Lecture, with Beginner's 
Pig Slave Courses to Hard B**** Courses.

00:03:57.870 --> 00:03:59.800
Which do you desire?

00:03:59.800 --> 00:04:02.300
I was a fool to get my hopes up!

00:04:02.300 --> 00:04:04.920
Well, setting those jokes aside,

00:04:04.920 --> 00:04:06.300
what did you want to know?

00:04:07.120 --> 00:04:11.060
Have there been any major 
events nearby lately?

00:04:11.060 --> 00:04:12.490
Hmm...

00:04:13.860 --> 00:04:16.940
Like heroes doing something, perhaps?

00:04:17.180 --> 00:04:21.780
Actually, I did hear that some other 
country conducted a Hero Summoning.

00:04:21.780 --> 00:04:23.450
Hero Summoning?

00:04:23.450 --> 00:04:24.470
<i>Bingo!</i>

00:04:24.780 --> 00:04:30.200
They brought heroes from another world 
to defeat the resurrected Demon Lord.

00:04:30.200 --> 00:04:31.950
Demon Lord?!

00:04:31.950 --> 00:04:34.230
If you'd like to know more details about it,

00:04:34.230 --> 00:04:36.460
the Royal Library's a good place.

00:04:36.700 --> 00:04:38.170
Royal Library?

00:04:38.550 --> 00:04:41.960
Here's a map to the library.

00:04:42.640 --> 00:04:44.920
I'm surprised you fit that in there!

00:04:44.920 --> 00:04:46.720
It has to reek!

00:04:49.220 --> 00:04:51.370
Hero Summoning, huh?

00:04:51.980 --> 00:04:55.910
Maybe I'll be able to learn something 
about Kannazuki-senpai and the others.

00:05:00.980 --> 00:05:02.990
What is he doing?!

00:05:03.220 --> 00:05:07.720
That damn Zakia hasn't had them 
do any practical training?

00:05:07.720 --> 00:05:10.990
Then what was the point 
of the Hero Summoning?!

00:05:10.990 --> 00:05:16.500
Many of the heroes themselves are also 
requesting real battles against monsters.

00:05:16.500 --> 00:05:18.620
Does he have any idea how extensive

00:05:18.620 --> 00:05:22.760
the damage will be if the Demon Lord rises 
when they haven't had any training?!

00:05:22.760 --> 00:05:28.680
In that case, why not enroll the 
heroes at Barbador Magic Academy?

00:05:28.680 --> 00:05:31.010
Barbador Magic Academy?

00:05:31.010 --> 00:05:34.400
With their solid foundation,
they'll easily dominate

00:05:34.400 --> 00:05:37.390
the top ranks at the Academy 
if we send them there.

00:05:37.390 --> 00:05:43.030
That would allow us to show other 
nations the power of the Kaiser Empire.

00:05:43.620 --> 00:05:45.530
You think it'll work that well?

00:05:45.530 --> 00:05:47.380
I'm sure it will be fine.

00:05:47.380 --> 00:05:50.330
The heroes we summoned 
are still just children.

00:05:50.330 --> 00:05:53.040
It will be easy to make them obey.

00:05:53.040 --> 00:05:55.540
And how will you do that?

00:05:57.060 --> 00:05:59.330
We'll make them wear these

00:05:59.330 --> 00:06:01.540
so that they can never disobey an order.

00:06:01.540 --> 00:06:03.840
Enslavement Bracelets, huh?

00:06:03.840 --> 00:06:05.050
Now I see.

00:06:12.420 --> 00:06:14.560
<i>I'm acting weird!</i>

00:06:26.390 --> 00:06:29.620
<i>I ran away at the mere sight of Seiichi...</i>

00:06:30.110 --> 00:06:35.450
<i>And just thinking about 
him makes my heart...</i>

00:06:40.520 --> 00:06:45.450
I wonder if this will have detailed accounts 
of where the heroes were summoned.

00:06:45.820 --> 00:06:47.130
<i>Regardless...</i>

00:06:47.440 --> 00:06:51.890
<i>Every book I read portrays mankind 
as just and the Demon Lord as evil.</i>

00:06:54.680 --> 00:06:59.200
<i>But they both suffered cruel 
fates at the hands of man.</i>

00:06:59.720 --> 00:07:02.940
I don't know what's true and what isn't.

00:07:04.670 --> 00:07:06.280
I need a change of pace.

00:07:07.910 --> 00:07:12.200
Come to think of it, I don't know 
that much about magic, either.

00:07:13.610 --> 00:07:15.700
Okay, let's see here...

00:07:15.700 --> 00:07:20.570
"To activate magic, you need 
visualization and mana."

00:07:20.570 --> 00:07:25.000
"Top class mages don't require visualization 
and can use magic without chants—"

00:07:25.000 --> 00:07:27.620
<i>Skill: Omit Chant acquired.</i>

00:07:28.250 --> 00:07:30.940
Nah, no way.

00:07:33.710 --> 00:07:37.220
<i>Ice Magic: Master acquired.</i>

00:07:38.630 --> 00:07:41.070
Look, all I did was flip the page.

00:07:42.960 --> 00:07:46.480
<i>Lightning Magic: Master acquired.</i>

00:07:47.560 --> 00:07:49.990
Seriously, all I did was flip the page!

00:07:49.990 --> 00:07:54.990
<i>Fire Magic, Water Magic, 
Light Magic, Wind Magic...</i>

00:07:54.990 --> 00:07:56.430
<i>Congratulations!</i>

00:07:56.430 --> 00:07:59.600
<i>You have acquired all elemental 
magics at their highest ranks.</i>

00:07:59.600 --> 00:08:01.790
You're kidding me!

00:08:01.790 --> 00:08:05.000
<i>Skill: Magic Creation acquired.</i>

00:08:05.500 --> 00:08:07.460
<i>Skill: Pinnacle of Sorcery acquired.</i>

00:08:07.460 --> 00:08:09.030
<i>Skill: Composite Magic acquired.</i>

00:08:08.040 --> 00:08:09.030
Cut it...

00:08:09.030 --> 00:08:10.510
C-Cut it out already...

00:08:09.030 --> 00:08:13.640
<i>Skills: Mass Activation, Enchant Magic: 
Master, and Circle Magic: Master acquired.</i>

00:08:10.830 --> 00:08:14.410
Let me go back to being a normal boy!

00:08:22.590 --> 00:08:24.440
Wait for me!

00:08:27.900 --> 00:08:30.320
Saria is a normal girl!

00:08:33.350 --> 00:08:35.500
Gorilla!

00:08:38.950 --> 00:08:40.380
Oh, well.

00:08:40.380 --> 00:08:44.450
I guess I'll have to take my time looking 
into Kannazuki-senpai and the others.

00:08:46.210 --> 00:08:49.380
<i>Oh, yeah. I haven't eaten lunch yet.</i>

00:08:54.670 --> 00:08:58.320
A-Animal ears?!

00:08:59.800 --> 00:09:01.970
W-Welcome!

00:09:01.970 --> 00:09:04.480
Oh, no, I'm not...

00:09:04.710 --> 00:09:06.980
Please, have a look.

00:09:10.430 --> 00:09:12.640
Did you paint all these yourself?

00:09:12.640 --> 00:09:14.680
Y-Yes, I did!

00:09:14.680 --> 00:09:16.000
Wow...

00:09:17.060 --> 00:09:19.490
<i>They're all such gentle paintings.</i>

00:09:19.720 --> 00:09:21.610
How much for this painting?

00:09:21.610 --> 00:09:22.420
Huh?!

00:09:22.420 --> 00:09:24.750
Huh? Are they not for sale?

00:09:24.750 --> 00:09:27.950
N-No, you're just the first to ask.

00:09:30.240 --> 00:09:31.980
Thank you very much!

00:09:32.380 --> 00:09:35.360
I'll just put this in my Item Box.

00:09:36.880 --> 00:09:37.940
Now...

00:09:39.100 --> 00:09:41.650
Huh? Th-That smell...

00:09:50.940 --> 00:09:52.150
Over there!

00:09:53.900 --> 00:09:56.400
Café Accogliente?

00:09:57.650 --> 00:10:00.450
Mm, what a nice smell!

00:10:01.960 --> 00:10:03.910
<i>Wait, what if...</i>

00:10:03.910 --> 00:10:06.580
Come on, you perverted, masochist pigs!

00:10:06.580 --> 00:10:09.670
<i>...it's something like that again?!</i>

00:10:12.370 --> 00:10:14.110
But I can't beat my empty stomach!

00:10:14.110 --> 00:10:14.990
Let's go!

00:10:16.650 --> 00:10:18.340
Welcome.

00:10:19.360 --> 00:10:21.350
Haven't seen you before.

00:10:21.350 --> 00:10:24.350
Huh? Oh, uh, I'm...

00:10:24.350 --> 00:10:28.250
Well, don't just stand there. Come on in.

00:10:28.850 --> 00:10:32.480
Welcome to Café Accogliente.

00:10:35.730 --> 00:10:37.200
<i>What's going on?</i>

00:10:37.200 --> 00:10:40.990
<i>What is this longing that 
makes my chest feel so tight?</i>

00:10:45.490 --> 00:10:48.980
What on earth is wrong with me?

00:10:48.980 --> 00:10:52.500
Shall I give you some advice, then?

00:10:52.810 --> 00:10:53.590
Huh?

00:10:53.590 --> 00:10:57.130
How do you do, Artoria-chan?

00:10:59.010 --> 00:11:00.750
Adrianna-san.

00:11:04.310 --> 00:11:06.140
Chow time!

00:11:13.570 --> 00:11:15.950
<i>The cream is rich, but not too overbearing,</i>

00:11:15.950 --> 00:11:19.970
<i>and it combines with the perfect doneness 
of the pasta and the savoriness of the meat</i>

00:11:19.970 --> 00:11:22.410
<i>to create a unique harmony.</i>

00:11:23.020 --> 00:11:24.410
<i>Which makes this...</i>

00:11:26.910 --> 00:11:28.900
Delicious!

00:11:34.100 --> 00:11:37.180
First time I've seen you here. Adventurer?

00:11:37.180 --> 00:11:41.680
Yeah, I officially became an 
adventurer just yesterday.

00:11:41.680 --> 00:11:45.070
I'm Ranze, a humble commoner.

00:11:45.070 --> 00:11:46.180
Nice to meet you.

00:11:46.550 --> 00:11:48.930
My name's Hiiragi Seiichi.

00:11:48.930 --> 00:11:50.290
Seiichi?

00:11:50.850 --> 00:11:54.440
Going by your name, 
you're from the Eastern Nation?

00:11:54.440 --> 00:11:55.240
Huh?

00:11:54.440 --> 00:11:56.770
<b>Far East</b>

00:11:57.630 --> 00:11:59.940
W-Well, yeah, I guess so.

00:11:59.940 --> 00:12:04.410
The Eastern Nation's famous for 
its many powerful warriors.

00:12:04.410 --> 00:12:05.640
Are you one, too?

00:12:05.640 --> 00:12:07.610
I-I guess so.

00:12:10.360 --> 00:12:13.210
This is the owner of this café, Noahd.

00:12:13.210 --> 00:12:15.960
It's a pleasure to meet you.

00:12:15.960 --> 00:12:18.220
Oh, same here!

00:12:18.220 --> 00:12:19.650
<i>That freaked me out.</i>

00:12:19.650 --> 00:12:22.460
<i>I thought they'd realized 
I came from another world.</i>

00:12:26.470 --> 00:12:28.970
In short, you're in love.

00:12:28.970 --> 00:12:30.720
L-Love?!

00:12:30.960 --> 00:12:32.570
Your first love, at that.

00:12:32.570 --> 00:12:34.660
I-Impossible!

00:12:34.660 --> 00:12:36.230
Me?!

00:12:36.230 --> 00:12:37.620
Absolutely not!

00:12:37.620 --> 00:12:42.490
If that's true, then what's that 
ring on your left ring finger about?

00:12:44.990 --> 00:12:47.360
A vow of eternal love.

00:12:47.360 --> 00:12:49.490
That's common knowledge, isn't it?

00:12:51.500 --> 00:12:56.250
Besides, thanks to that ring, 
your curse has been lifted.

00:12:57.190 --> 00:12:58.310
But...

00:13:00.700 --> 00:13:03.510
<i>Seiichi already has Saria...</i>

00:13:05.210 --> 00:13:06.590
Artoria-chan?

00:13:10.160 --> 00:13:11.850
Why don't you admit it already?

00:13:12.380 --> 00:13:15.100
You're in love with Seiichi-san.

00:13:15.880 --> 00:13:16.600
In love?

00:13:18.730 --> 00:13:21.690
We're here to save you, Artoria-san!

00:13:22.100 --> 00:13:24.990
I'll stay with you for as long it takes.

00:13:24.990 --> 00:13:28.030
I'll fully support you!

00:13:28.950 --> 00:13:30.420
So that's it...

00:13:30.420 --> 00:13:33.040
I'm... in love.

00:13:33.550 --> 00:13:34.340
Yeah.

00:13:36.680 --> 00:13:39.540
Is it really okay for me to fall in love?

00:13:39.540 --> 00:13:41.000
Of course it is.

00:13:41.670 --> 00:13:46.280
Um... what do you think I can 
do to get Seiichi's attention?

00:13:46.280 --> 00:13:47.170
Huh?

00:13:47.170 --> 00:13:51.220
I want to let Seiichi know how I feel.

00:13:51.680 --> 00:13:55.930
I want Seiichi to love me the way I love him!

00:13:57.730 --> 00:13:59.370
Leave it to me!

00:13:59.370 --> 00:14:02.820
I'll teach you the perfect way 
to win Seiichi-san's heart!

00:14:05.210 --> 00:14:06.820
No way!

00:14:07.570 --> 00:14:10.280
Uh, was that a bad thing to do?

00:14:10.280 --> 00:14:12.330
It goes beyond bad.

00:14:12.650 --> 00:14:17.200
In this country, when a man 
presents a woman with a ring

00:14:17.200 --> 00:14:19.800
and places it on her left ring finger,

00:14:19.800 --> 00:14:22.090
it's a symbol of his vow of eternal love.

00:14:23.320 --> 00:14:28.220
And if you even try to say, 
"Just kidding!" or "My mistake!"

00:14:28.220 --> 00:14:30.340
You'll be executed.

00:14:30.340 --> 00:14:32.350
E-Executed?!

00:14:32.350 --> 00:14:36.100
At best, castrated.

00:14:37.350 --> 00:14:39.100
<b>Castrated</b>

00:14:39.100 --> 00:14:41.860
A-Anything but that!

00:14:42.220 --> 00:14:45.360
Then why not just marry her already?

00:14:45.360 --> 00:14:47.080
M-Marry?!

00:14:47.080 --> 00:14:49.290
You already swore eternal love.

00:14:49.290 --> 00:14:50.860
What else is there to do?

00:14:50.860 --> 00:14:52.880
B-But...

00:14:56.680 --> 00:15:01.420
You already have your heart set 
on another woman, don't you?

00:15:01.840 --> 00:15:03.420
Well, yes...

00:15:03.420 --> 00:15:08.130
Then just cultivate eternal 
love for both of them.

00:15:08.130 --> 00:15:10.700
You gotta be open-minded enough for that.

00:15:10.700 --> 00:15:13.420
Wh-What?!

00:15:16.310 --> 00:15:20.690
Let me give you one piece 
of advice as your elder.

00:15:20.690 --> 00:15:24.440
Never give them a vague answer.

00:15:24.440 --> 00:15:29.810
Either take responsibility 
or give them a sincere apology.

00:15:29.810 --> 00:15:32.470
Make sure you give them a proper decision.

00:15:33.990 --> 00:15:35.310
Got it.

00:15:35.310 --> 00:15:38.950
I think I'll try to explain 
myself clearly in person.

00:15:39.760 --> 00:15:41.250
Thank you for the meal.

00:15:41.250 --> 00:15:43.070
The tea was delicious.

00:15:43.070 --> 00:15:44.960
Thank you very much.

00:15:44.960 --> 00:15:47.450
Let's talk more if we see each other again.

00:15:48.080 --> 00:15:49.460
Yes, definitely!

00:15:51.500 --> 00:15:53.110
Ah, to be young.

00:15:54.020 --> 00:15:57.260
Ranze, even though I'm here,

00:15:57.260 --> 00:16:00.740
you're exposing yourself 
too much coming here alone.

00:16:00.740 --> 00:16:01.980
You're still the...

00:16:01.980 --> 00:16:03.750
Don't worry.

00:16:03.750 --> 00:16:07.730
The Kingdom's strongest swordsman, 
Louise, will be coming to get me.

00:16:07.730 --> 00:16:11.990
I feel bad for Louise-sama, having to 
go along with your whims all the time.

00:16:16.910 --> 00:16:18.980
See? She's here.

00:16:25.540 --> 00:16:26.830
A decision, huh?

00:16:27.290 --> 00:16:29.810
<i>I know I can't drag this out.</i>

00:16:30.230 --> 00:16:31.510
<i>But I...</i>

00:16:41.020 --> 00:16:43.670
I wonder if Saria's still here.

00:16:43.670 --> 00:16:46.340
I-I can take my time thinking it over today

00:16:46.340 --> 00:16:48.990
and come to a decision tomorrow!

00:16:48.990 --> 00:16:52.020
I'm already here to pick up Saria...

00:16:52.440 --> 00:16:55.010
And while I feel bad for Artoria-san,

00:16:55.010 --> 00:16:57.370
I'll tell her tomorrow.

00:16:57.370 --> 00:16:58.710
Y-Yeah!

00:16:59.240 --> 00:17:01.530
I'm the worst.

00:17:02.560 --> 00:17:03.790
Seiichi!

00:17:09.010 --> 00:17:11.070
A-Artoria-san?

00:17:13.850 --> 00:17:15.900
<i>Artoria-san's right here in front of me.</i>

00:17:16.560 --> 00:17:20.810
<i>Now's the time to clear up the 
misunderstanding about that ring, isn't it?</i>

00:17:21.190 --> 00:17:24.810
<i>She might not forgive me, 
but I have to apologize, right?</i>

00:17:25.130 --> 00:17:26.770
<i>So go on, say it!</i>

00:17:27.100 --> 00:17:28.660
<i>What are you afraid of?!</i>

00:17:29.120 --> 00:17:33.000
<i>Say it, say it, say it, say it!</i>

00:17:34.130 --> 00:17:35.350
Artoria-san!

00:17:35.710 --> 00:17:37.830
Um, that ring—

00:17:40.610 --> 00:17:44.790
<i>Th-This is... a kiss, isn't it?</i>

00:17:48.030 --> 00:17:50.270
Don't say any more.

00:17:51.090 --> 00:17:52.300
I know.

00:17:52.650 --> 00:17:57.800
I know you didn't give me this 
ring because you felt that way.

00:17:57.800 --> 00:17:59.090
Then...

00:17:59.090 --> 00:18:01.100
But I don't care!

00:18:03.340 --> 00:18:04.880
I don't care.

00:18:05.600 --> 00:18:08.100
Because I've fallen in love with you.

00:18:09.020 --> 00:18:12.560
I mean, I know you already have Saria...

00:18:12.560 --> 00:18:16.730
But... But I still fell in love with you!

00:18:16.730 --> 00:18:19.990
Just seeing you makes my heart ache!

00:18:20.260 --> 00:18:21.620
Artoria-san...

00:18:21.620 --> 00:18:23.200
Am I not good enough?

00:18:23.650 --> 00:18:27.160
Can I not stay by your side?

00:18:27.920 --> 00:18:29.620
That's not...

00:18:29.620 --> 00:18:33.470
I know I'm not ladylike, 
and maybe I'm not very lovable,

00:18:34.190 --> 00:18:35.730
but I still...

00:18:36.440 --> 00:18:37.730
Artoria-san...

00:18:39.930 --> 00:18:43.500
<i>I can't choose between them!</i>

00:18:44.140 --> 00:18:48.730
Then just cultivate eternal 
love for both of them.

00:18:49.500 --> 00:18:50.730
But...

00:18:51.000 --> 00:18:52.510
I really...

00:18:54.210 --> 00:18:55.130
I...

00:18:55.990 --> 00:18:57.080
Saria!

00:19:00.990 --> 00:19:02.720
Saria?!

00:19:02.720 --> 00:19:05.740
Uh, this... This isn't what you think!

00:19:06.080 --> 00:19:07.750
Accept her.

00:19:08.070 --> 00:19:09.120
Huh?

00:19:09.120 --> 00:19:12.840
I'm a little sad that I can't 
have you all to myself,

00:19:12.840 --> 00:19:17.630
but I never expected to be able 
to monopolize your charms.

00:19:17.630 --> 00:19:21.010
Y-You're so...

00:19:21.010 --> 00:19:25.760
Besides, females naturally 
flock to strong males.

00:19:26.600 --> 00:19:27.770
Females?

00:19:27.770 --> 00:19:30.770
You're still a gorilla when it comes to that...

00:19:30.770 --> 00:19:35.850
So, Seiichi, make sure you 
accept Artoria-san, okay?

00:19:35.850 --> 00:19:40.030
I love Artoria-san, as well, 
so I want to be with her, too.

00:19:40.820 --> 00:19:42.530
Saria...

00:19:48.010 --> 00:19:49.130
Artoria-san...

00:19:49.910 --> 00:19:50.710
Ar.

00:19:50.710 --> 00:19:51.410
Huh?

00:19:52.000 --> 00:19:54.070
Call me Ar.

00:19:54.380 --> 00:19:58.590
That's the nickname used by those 
who are really close to me.

00:19:58.910 --> 00:20:01.420
Also, drop the honorifics!

00:20:02.290 --> 00:20:04.180
You got it, Ar.

00:20:08.400 --> 00:20:10.550
I love you, too, Ar.

00:20:21.190 --> 00:20:22.160
Ar...

00:20:23.060 --> 00:20:26.640
I know I'm kind of hopeless and unreliable,

00:20:27.400 --> 00:20:32.710
but I'll do my best to make sure 
you don't regret falling for me.

00:20:33.830 --> 00:20:34.630
Yeah!

00:20:35.530 --> 00:20:38.400
Now Ar and I are together, too!

00:20:44.280 --> 00:20:45.710
Congratulations!

00:20:47.090 --> 00:20:48.330
Congratulations.

00:20:49.210 --> 00:20:50.690
Congratulations.

00:20:50.690 --> 00:20:51.980
Congratulations.

00:20:52.860 --> 00:20:54.480
Congratulations.

00:20:56.700 --> 00:20:58.230
Thank you!

00:20:58.230 --> 00:21:01.700
Is it okay for things to end this way?

00:22:43.040 --> 00:22:56.310
<b>Seiichi's Status for Today</b>

00:22:43.990 --> 00:22:47.040
I-It's time for "Seiichi's Status—"

00:22:47.040 --> 00:22:48.750
Clap, clap, clap!

00:22:48.750 --> 00:22:51.030
I stuttered right at the start.

