00:23:03.870 --> 00:23:05.170
Hey, Ar,

00:23:05.090 --> 00:23:35.010
<b>Magic Creation</b>

00:23:05.170 --> 00:23:07.530
what's this "Magic Creation"?

00:23:07.530 --> 00:23:12.060
Apparently, it's a skill that lets 
him create his own new magic.

00:23:12.060 --> 00:23:15.520
As long as he has a clear 
visualization and gives it a name,

00:23:15.520 --> 00:23:17.980
he can create any kind of spell.

00:23:17.980 --> 00:23:20.020
Wow! That's useful!

00:23:20.020 --> 00:23:22.760
I want... to make something with Seiichi.

00:23:22.760 --> 00:23:25.190
Huh? You want to make what?

00:23:25.190 --> 00:23:26.340
Blush...

00:23:26.340 --> 00:23:27.130
Ar?

00:23:27.130 --> 00:23:30.640
N-Not that! Mem... mem... memories!

00:23:30.640 --> 00:23:32.880
I want to make memories!

00:23:35.430 --> 00:23:38.460
I'm now surrounded by Saria and 
Artoria, two beautiful women,

00:23:38.460 --> 00:23:41.030
when a new heroine quickly appears!

00:23:41.030 --> 00:23:42.790
As for her looks, she's...

00:23:42.790 --> 00:23:43.770
a donkey?!

